    "Point estimate sits between published GPT-4 (62.03%) and GPT-4+CausalCoT (70.40%) overalls; well below CRAwDAD dual-agent SOTA (~89%).",
    "Rung difficulty ordering matches the paper (R1>R2>R3).",
    "PCCR certificates are not an LLM SOTA method; they provide machine-checkable ID when the SCM/graph is explicit."
